==Strategy==
With a basic meatshield, an anti-Zombie, and a ranged crit unit, this stage should be relatively straightforward. Bring [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] to cover for Zigge and Zuche burrows. This is one of the hardest Zombie stages in this event, so you do not need to be cautious about using strong anti-Zombie units.

